    "text": "From <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mi>o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>40</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi></math><br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image37-2b5bd301-23cf-4899-84b6-e0dc6423363e.jpg\" /><br /><br />From <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cot</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mi>o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>40</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi></math><br /><br />Distance between the men <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>109.28</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi></math> .",
